Rocket Launcher (by Prezentree) bundles it so the Google Play policy audit works
offline and for free. Rocket Launcher reads resources/scanner_config.json and
resources/policies.json for its own quick scan and points AI agents to SKILL.md
for the full audit. No files in this folder were changed.

Google says AI can make mistakes: the audit is a checklist to review, not a
Play review decision.
